1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,868
To stop an army of a hundred

2
00:00:01,868 --> 00:00:02,960
and fifty thousand men,

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,640
he opened the gates.

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:05,560
And played a song.

5
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:07,400
You see, his soldiers are far away.

6
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,840
In this little town he has a

7
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,620
few thousand men, mostly cooks and old

8
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:10,940
guards.

9
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,520
Then a scout runs in:

10
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,640
the enemy's entire army is coming,

11
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,540
and it's almost here.

12
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:16,240
Run?

13
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,000
Too slow.

14
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:17,380
Fight?

15
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,100
Impossible.

16
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:19,880
His officers start to panic.

17
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,300
So he gives the strangest orders of

18
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:22,640
the war.

19
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:23,980
Take down every flag.

20
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,160
Hide every soldier.

21
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,600
Open all the gates.

22
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,600
And sweep the road,

23
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:28,680
like guests are coming.

24
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,980
Then he climbs the wall,

25
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,020
lights some incense, sits down with his

26
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,360
zither, and starts to play.

27
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:33,900
Smiling.

28
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,060
The enemy general rides up and freezes.

29
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:36,860
Open gates.

30
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:37,900
Empty streets.

31
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,920
A man playing music.

32
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,000
He knows this man.

33
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,180
He never takes risks.

34
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:42,620
Never.

35
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,000
So this has to be a trap.

36
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,900
And he turns the whole army around

37
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,660
and runs.

38
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,620
You see, a careful man doesn't bluff.

39
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,440
So nobody believed he was bluffing.

40
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,860
Behind those walls there was no army.

41
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:54,880
Just cooks.

42
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,900
And one very good actor.

